--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Downloaded at runtime from the projects' own servers, NOT redistributed here:

  proot                      GPL-2.0    https://github.com/proot-me/proot
    - fetched at runtime as an unmodified prebuilt Android binary from the
      Termux package mirror (packages.termux.dev), together with its libtalloc
      and libandroid-shmem dependencies. Invoked as a separate process (mere
      aggregation); every download is SHA-256 verified against the mirror index.
      Corresponding source and build scripts are published by their projects; a
      written offer appears in the app's "Open source notices" screen.
  libtalloc                  LGPL-3.0   (Termux build) — proot dependency
  libandroid-shmem           MIT        (Termux build) — proot dependency
  Alpine Linux minirootfs    (mixed, per distribution) https://alpinelinux.org
    - ~4 MB, fetched at runtime from dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org and SHA-256 checked
      against the mirror's latest-releases.yaml.
  Language servers (gopls, pyright, rust-analyzer, ...) — user-installed into the
      Linux sandbox; Kodelab only speaks the Language Server Protocol.

